error[E4102]: cannot assign to `a` because it is borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4102_assign_while_borrowed.tarn:30:5
   |
29 |     r := &a
   |          -- shared borrow of `a` starts here
30 |     a = Buffer.new()
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ assigned here while borrowed
31 |     read(r)
   |          - the borrow is still used here
